### Check Status
GET http://localhost:8080/api/driver/status

### Add a Trip
POST http://localhost:8080/api/driver/trip
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "tripId": "T001",
    "pickupLocation": "Reagan Airport",
    "dropoffLocation": "Downtown DC",
    "distanceMiles": 8.5,
    "estimatedEarnings": 24.50,
    "durationMinutes": 25
}

### Get All Trips
GET http://localhost:8080/api/driver/trips